---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /claim/
title: Claim a listing
description: Organisers can ask for a correction or an update to their event's listing on hackathon.so.
noindex: noindex
scripts: ["/assets/js/claim.js"]
---
<p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Claim a listing</p>
<h1>Claim this listing</h1>
<p class="lede">Run this event? Tell us who you are and what should change. We check every request against the event's own page before editing anything, and reply by email.</p>
<p id="claim-event" class="claim-event" hidden></p>

{%- if site.claimFormEndpoint %}
<form class="claim-form" id="claim-form" action="{{ site.claimFormEndpoint }}" method="POST">
  <input type="hidden" name="_subject" id="claim-subject" value="hackathon.so listing claim">
  <label>Listing on hackathon.so
    <input type="url" name="listing" id="claim-listing" required placeholder="{{ site.url }}/hackathons/...">
  </label>
  <label>Your name
    <input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120">
  </label>
  <label>Organisation
    <input type="text" name="organisation" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160">
  </label>
  <label>Email
    <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200">
  </label>
  <label>What you want changed
    <textarea name="changes" rows="6" required maxlength="3000" placeholder="For example: the deadline moved, the prize list changed, or this is a duplicate of another listing."></textarea>
  </label>
  {#- Spam trap: people never see or fill this field. -#}
  <label class="trap" aria-hidden="true">Leave this empty <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
  <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" id="claim-submit">Send request</button>
  <p class="source-note">Your request goes by email to the hackathon.so team through Formspree, a form service. We use your details only to answer this request.</p>
</form>
<div class="claim-done" id="claim-done" role="status" hidden>
  <h2>Request sent</h2>
  <p>Thanks. We will check the event's own page and reply by email.</p>
</div>
<p class="notice" id="claim-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
{%- else %}
<p class="notice">The claim form is not connected yet. Set CLAIM_FORM_ENDPOINT when building the site.</p>
{%- endif %}
